{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q10", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主于虚龄34至43时的田宅运？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "命主八字辛亥 辛丑 戊戌 丁巳，戊土日主生于丑月，得时支巳火、丁火生扶，身强土旺，以金水木为用，火土为忌。田宅看印星，原局时柱丁巳为印，但忌神印星被年支亥水财星冲克，巳亥冲为家宅不稳、得而复失之象。地支行丑戌刑，容易在房产合约上产生纠纷。\n\n虚龄34至43岁（约2005-2014年）行戊戌大运末尾及丁酉大运初期。戊戌运比肩重重，有争财破耗之兆。交入丁酉运（约2012年后），天干丁火印星为忌，地支酉金伤官本为喜神，却被丁火克制，构成“印克伤官”，即想法受挫、金融机构（酉金）受阻。2012壬辰年，流年与日柱戊戌天克地冲（壬克戊，辰冲戌），冲动田宅宫，主屋宅大事；天干丁壬合，为“财合印”，花钱购房之象，但地支辰戌冲土更旺，比劫夺财，且运支酉与流年辰虽合，但被冲散，代表贷款合约不成，最终财（订金）被夺而房屋（印）落空，非常契合选项C。其他选项与命理趋势不符。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q10", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 104785, "response_id": "788ad776-4ed4-41ae-864d-2256d63a48d8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 247, "completion_tokens": 5801, "total_tokens": 6048, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5474}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 119}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n日主丁火生于子月，天干透三金（辛、庚、辛），地支酉丑合金，子丑合水，全局金水极旺，丁火无根无生，身弱至极，属于“从财官格”，喜金、水、湿土，忌木、火、燥土。\n\n大运逆排，约8岁起运：己亥（8-17）、戊戌（18-27）、丁酉（28-37）、丙申（38-47）、乙未（48-57）、甲午（58-67）。\n\n- **23-32岁（A）**：行戊戌运及丁酉运前期。戊戌运燥土为忌，戌中有丁火根气，逆格多凶；丁酉运比肩透干夺财，虽有酉金喜神，但整体仍属坎坷，非最佳。\n- **33-42岁（B）**：行丁酉运后期及丙申运前期。丁酉运平平；丙申运申金为喜，申子合水助官星，天干丙辛合水化官，忌神转喜，此为人生事业财运的黄金期，前半段上涨势头显著，整体向上。\n- **43-52岁（C）**：行丙申运后期及乙未运前期。丙申运延续好运，但进入乙未运后，未土冲动丑库，印星破格生身，运势急剧转下，破财多灾，整体不如B段平稳。\n- **53-62岁（D）**：行乙未运后期及甲午运。甲午运日主得禄破格，午冲子犯旺官，为大凶之运，最差。\n\n综合比较，B段（33-42岁）包含丁酉末与丙申初，趋势向上，且丙申为全命最佳大运；C段（43-52岁）虽含丙申余吉，但衔接乙未凶运，后势崩塌，整体评价略低。故最佳选择为B。\n\n### 最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 79396, "response_id": "e228f3f9-db01-4b4d-9f5c-e5a0e6fe8fde", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 5169, "total_tokens": 5384, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4714}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命盘分析，命主丁火生于子月，金寒水冷，地支无根无印，八字从弱，喜金水，忌木火。原局财星多现，妻宫为酉金偏财，婚姻较晚。大运方面，7岁起运，逆行己亥、戊戌、丁酉、丙申等。17-26岁戊戌大运，燥土忌神逆势，难成婚。27-36岁丁酉大运，比肩坐偏财，妻宫伏吟，引动婚姻宫。其中1993癸酉年，流年伏吟日柱，且癸水制丁火比肩，金水喜神当旺，最利成婚，命主时年32周岁，属23—32岁区间。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 36439, "response_id": "9acafbce-89ba-41f5-b10c-c247fc6c0914", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 2334, "total_tokens": 2542, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2157}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 80}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，丁火生于子月，七杀当令，月柱庚子财生杀旺，年时辛丑食神生财，财又党杀，日主丁火孤立无援，无印化杀，亦无有力食伤制杀，构成财杀攻身之局，命格中暗藏官非刑罚信息。\n\n大运推算，阴年男命逆排，起运约7岁8个月。各步大运为：7-16岁己亥，17-26岁戊戌，27-36岁丁酉，37-46岁丙申，47-56岁乙未。官非出现多应于财杀同旺、制化无力的运程。己亥、戊戌运虽有食伤透干，但官杀得地，已埋隐患；丁酉运比肩坐财，财星生杀，七杀无制，为最凶险之运。此运与年时丑半合金局，月令子水七杀得旺财滋生，攻身猛烈。流年壬申（1992年），丁壬合官，申子半合水局，官杀汇聚，日主极弱易有牢狱官非。此年命主虚岁32，处于23—32岁区间。因此，官非刑事出现于该阶段。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 51567, "response_id": "be63f365-177f-4576-8ecd-b3ae9ffac97d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 214, "completion_tokens": 3299, "total_tokens": 3513, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3004}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **八字分析**：  \n   命主八字为辛丑、庚子、丁酉、辛丑。日主丁火生于子月，地处寒冬，水旺火弱；天干透庚辛金，地支酉丑合金、子丑合土（亦增金水之势），全局金水极旺，财多身弱，七杀攻身，是典型的**身弱不胜财杀**之局，易有凶险。\n\n2. **大运分析**：  \n   男命年干为辛（阴），阴男逆排大运。从月柱庚子逆排得：己亥、戊戌、丁酉、丙申……。起运时间需从出生日（1961年12月30日）逆数至上一个节气“大雪”（12月7日），约22天，约**7岁起运**。第一步大运为**己亥**（约1968—1977年）。  \n   - 己土食神浮于亥水之上，制杀力量微弱，而亥水与原局子、丑会成水方，七杀愈旺，形成**食神无力制杀、杀旺攻身**的危险运程。\n\n3. **流年应期分析**：  \n   - **A. 1965年（乙巳）**：流年乙木生火，巳火为丁火之根，帮扶日主，凶灾概率较低。  \n   - **B. 1968年（戊申）**：此为交运之年，戊土伤官透出，申金为财，申子半合水局，水势亦强，但戊土尚可勉强制水，且交运之初，凶兆未至极点。  \n   - **C. 1971年（辛亥）**：大运己亥，流年辛亥，命局有子，**两亥一子汇聚北方水局**，汪洋一片；天干辛金双双透出，金生水势不可挡。丁火日主之**绝地在亥**，流年与大运两亥冲一巳（丁火之根），丁火毫无生机，七杀无制攻身，是**生命最薄弱之时**，极大概率出现凶劫之灾。  \n   - **D. 1974年（甲寅）**：甲木正印高透，寅木为火长生之地，寅亥合木化杀生印，印来生身，反为转机，不主凶灾。\n\n4. **综合判断**：  \n   1971年辛亥为水势顶峰，丁火绝灭之期，正应原局身弱不胜旺杀之病，凶劫之灾当在此年。\n\n### 最终答案\nC", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 22571, "response_id": "0766525f-1712-4d4c-abd1-e023515153ca", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 1584, "total_tokens": 1803, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "