{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q15", "domain": "unknown", "question": "那个时段，破财最严重？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "首先，需排定命主大运。此命辛丑年属阴，男命阴年逆排，月柱庚子，逆推为己亥、戊戌、丁酉、丙申、乙未、甲午。生于1961年12月30日，距上一个节气大雪（12月7日）23天，起运约7岁8个月。大运：7-16岁己亥，17-26岁戊戌，27-36岁丁酉，37-46岁丙申，47-56岁乙未，57-66岁甲午。\n\n原局日主丁火，四柱金水极旺（三金二湿土一子水），丁火虚弱无根，为财多身弱、富屋贫人之造。金为财星，水为官杀，不堪重财杀。  \n- 23-32岁行戊戌至丁酉运：戊戌伤官生财，丁酉比肩无根，身弱难担旺财，多破损。  \n- 33-42岁行丁酉末至丙申运：丙申运劫财帮身，但申子半合水局，财生杀旺，日元被克更甚，易因财致祸，官非灾殃，破财最剧。  \n- 43-52岁行乙未运：印星生身，未为火余气，身强能任财，财运好转。  \n- 53-62岁行甲午运：甲印生身，午为丁禄强根，身旺可担财官，不破反得。  \n\n故破财最严重时段为33-42岁的丙申运。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q15", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 26006, "response_id": "031caf29-dde5-4242-8514-aa819a95c70e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 1989, "total_tokens": 2204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1621}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}}
{"case_id": "female_19831028_P004-Q16", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主有多重婚姻，目前是第几段婚姻？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "此命日主己土，生于戌月，土旺身强。原局官杀木星仅藏于年支亥中，夫星不显，且日支婚姻宫为丑土比肩，又逢月支戌土相刑，婚姻宫受损，先天夫缘浅薄，多婚之象。女命以官杀为夫，大运顺排：甲子运官星透干合身，当有初婚；乙丑运七杀虚透坐比肩，婚姻再度波动，为二婚之象；丙寅运正官得禄，印星化官，应有第三段婚姻。现行丁卯运（2027年转入），流年丁未冲婚姻宫丑土，且未为木库，夫星入墓被冲，主婚缘破散。结合大运刚换、流年冲击，丙寅运所得之第三段婚姻已在运序交替之际告终，现处离异单身状态，故为失婚。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "female_19831028_P004-Q16", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 86935, "response_id": "265ee495-790e-4831-9249-bf5ac71eedfe", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 5990, "total_tokens": 6205, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5771}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}}
